{
  "<size=24>Your HIGHLIGHT does not spend HIGHLIGHT Energy and can CRIT. On any ally's turn, if you have greater or equal to $1 stacks of <link=\"s|215\"><u>Posture</u></link>, you can <link=\"s|216\"><u>Transform</u></link> into [<link=\"s|217\"><u>Masquerade</u></link>] and use HIGHLIGHT once (<link=\"s|217\"><u>Masquerade</u></link> has a $2 turns cooldown), until the start of your second turn after you entered [<link=\"s|217\"><u>Masquerade</u></link>]. Under [<link=\"s|217\"><u>Masquerade</u></link>], for every 1 stack of <link=\"s|215\"><u>Posture</u></link>, increase ATK by $3 and Crit Rate by $4. Remove all <link=\"s|215\"><u>Posture</u></link> when [<link=\"s|217\"><u>Masquerade</u></link>] ends.</size>": "",
