  "Glimmer of Night <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "When you manually use this skill, deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Bless damage to 1 foe, and gain <link=\"s|215\"><u>Posture</u></link> [Brave Step], up to a $2 stack. When Dance Partner triggers this skill, deal <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> ATK Bless damage to 1 foe, and gain <link=\"s|215\"><u>Posture</u></link> [Brave Step], up to a $4 stack.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Even if there is only a ray of light, it can lead us to break through and dispel all darkness.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Dancing in Hand Lv.$1": "",
  "Dancing in Hand <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Select 1 ally to become the [Dance Partner] for $1 turn. Increase own and [Dance Partner] ATK by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns. gain <link=\"s|215\"><u>Posture</u></link> [Agile Step], up to $4 stack. After [Dance Partner] use a Persona skill, immediately use [Glimmer of Night] on 1 random foe (If [Dance Partner] used a skill that target a foe, change the main target of [Glimmer of Night] to that foe). There can only be 1 [Dance Partner].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>The bells are ringing and the music is starting to play, so take my hand and let's head out onto the dance floor and dance together.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Blooming Heart Lv.$1": "",
  "Blooming Heart <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> ATK Bless damage to 1 foe. If you are in [<link=\"s|217\"><u>Masquerade</u></link>], additionally increase skill damage by $2 and Crit DMG by <color=#FFFC40>$3</color>.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Comb through all your emotions and unravel all your confusions, and your blossoming heart will become the blade that breaks through everything!</color></size></b>": "",
