  "r:\"Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack, and gain Lead <link\\=(.+?)><u>Step</u></link>\\.\\nIf this skill is activated by an ally with Dance Partner, deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>, and gain (\\d+) Lead Step\\.\\nLead Step stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Grant Dance Partner to (\\d+) ally for (\\d+) turn\\. Only (\\d+) ally may have Dance Partner at one time\\.\\nIncrease Attack of Kasumi and the selected ally by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, Kasumi gains Follow <link\\=(.+?)><u>Step</u></link>\\. This effect does not stack\\.\\nWhen an ally with Dance Partner uses a skill, immediately activate Cinderella Glow (\\d+) time on (\\d+) random foe \\(if the skill is activated on a foe, activate Cinderella Glow (\\d+) time on that foe\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nWhen using this skill while in <link\\=(.+?)><u>Masquerade</u></link> mode, increase skill damage by (\\d+)%, and critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color>\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Can be activated in <link\\=(.+?)><u>Masquerade</u></link> mode\\. Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, with <link\\=(.+?)><u>Step</u></link> stacks, gain additional effects accordingly\\.\\nLead Step: Increase Highlight damage by (\\d+)% for each stack\\.\\nFollow Step: Increase Highlight critical rate by (\\d+)%, and critical damage by (\\d+)%\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Bless damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to (\\d+) foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to (\\d+) foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
