  "r:\"When an ally except Kasumi uses a Highlight or Theurgy, increase Kasumi's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. Stacks up to (\\d+) times\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Kasumi's\\s+Highlight\\s+does\\s+not\\s+deplete\\s+the\\s+Highlight\\s+gauge,\\s+and\\s+can\\s+activate\\s+critical\\s+hits\\.\\nOn\\s+an\\s+ally's\\s+action,\\s+with\\s+(\\d+)\\s+or\\s+more\\s+<link\\=(.+?)><u>Step</u></link>\\s+stacks,\\s+can\\s+use\\s+<link\\=(.+?)><u>Spellbound\\s+Cinders</u></link>\\s+to\\s+enter\\s+<link\\=(.+?)><u>Masquerade</u></link>\\s+mode,\\s+and\\s+can\\s+activate\\s+Highlight\\s+1\\s+time\\s+\\(Spellbound\\s+Cinders\\s+has\\s+a\\s+cooldown\\s+time\\s+of\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\)\\.\\s+This\\s+effect\\s+lasts\\s+until\\s+the\\s+start\\s+of\\s+Kasumi's\\s+second\\s+turn\\s+after\\s+entering\\s+Masquerade\\s+\\(or\\s+if\\s+Spellbound\\s+Cinders\\s+is\\s+used\\s+during\\s+her\\s+own\\s+turn,\\s+until\\s+the\\s+end\\s+of\\s+the\\s+following\\s+turn\\)\\.\\s+Also,\\s+for\\s+every\\s+Step\\s+stack\\s+gained\\s+while\\s+in\\s+Masquerade\\s+mode,\\s+increase\\s+Attack\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+and\\s+critical\\s+rate\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\.\\nWhen\\s+Masquerade\\s+ends,\\s+lose\\s+all\\s+Step\\s+stacks\\.\\s+If\\s+Masquerade\\s+ends\\s+and\\s+Highlight\\s+has\\s+not\\s+been\\s+used,\\s+activate\\s+Highlight\\s+on\\s+1\\s+random\\s+foe\\.\"": "",
  "Extend the duration of Dance Partner by 1 turn.\\nWhen using Invitation, increase critical rate of Kasumi and her Dance Partner by 15% for 3 turns.": "",
